{
  "id": 79724284,
  "iid": 1046,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "TLS: debug_file - no comment when processing comment lines",
  "description": "(Example files on [TLS wiki page](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/wikis/TLS#example-capture-file))  \n  \nComment (#) lines in the debug file were flagged with \"unrecognized line\".  \nBy the time someone gets to checking the debug file they're already confused and don't need distractions.  \n  \nFile format: [NSS Key Log Format](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Mozilla/Projects/NSS/Key_Log_Format)\n\nInput:  \n```\n# Cipher Suite ECDHE-RSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384\n# Foo - another comment\n#\nNot a comment\n# comment\nCLIENT_RANDOM foo2\nCLIENT_RANDOM 52362c10a2665e323a2adb4b9da0c10d4a8823719272f8b4c97af24f92784812 9F9A0F19A02BDDBE1A05926597D622CCA06D2AF416A28AD9C03163B87FF1B0C67824BBDB595B32D8027DB566EC04FB25\nCLIENT_RANDOM 52362c1012cf23628256e745e903cea696e9f62a60ba0ae8311d70dea5e41949 9F9A0F19A02BDDBE1A05926597D622CCA06D2AF416A28AD9C03163B87FF1B0C67824BBDB595B32D8027DB566EC04FB25\n```\n\nEntries in debug file after going silent on comments:  \n```\ntrying to use TLS keylog in C:\\Users\\IEUser\\Downloads\\premaster.txt\n  checking keylog line: # Cipher Suite ECDHE-RSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384\n  checking keylog line: # Foo - another comment\n  checking keylog line: #\n  checking keylog line: Not a comment\n    unrecognized line\n  checking keylog line: # comment\n  checking keylog line: CLIENT_RANDOM foo2\n    unrecognized line\n  checking keylog line: CLIENT_RANDOM 52362c10a2665e323a2adb4b9da0c10d4a8823719272f8b4c97af24f92784812 9F9A0F19A02BDDBE1A05926597D622CCA06D2AF416A28AD9C03163B87FF1B0C67824BBDB595B32D8027DB566EC04FB25\n    matched client_random\n  checking keylog line: CLIENT_RANDOM 52362c1012cf23628256e745e903cea696e9f62a60ba0ae8311d70dea5e41949 9F9A0F19A02BDDBE1A05926597D622CCA06D2AF416A28AD9C03163B87FF1B0C67824BBDB595B32D8027DB566EC04FB25\n    matched client_random\n```",
